    <!--
        No record rules are defined yet.

        This module ships RBAC purely through GROUP COMPOSITION (capability
        groups composed into role groups, see security_groups.xml) plus a
        minimal set of read-only ir.model.access entries. Least-privilege is
        achieved by what we deliberately DO NOT grant — not by row-level
        domains.

        Per-record (row-level) scoping — e.g. multi-company isolation or
        restricting a security analyst to their own audit records — will be
        added here once this module (or a sibling) introduces tech-specific
        models that warrant it. Until then this file exists solely so the
        manifest's reference to 'security/record_rules.xml' is valid.
    -->
